WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:02.520
2023 saw many big events.

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:04.040
Some provided good news.

00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:04.920
Most provided

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:05.640
bad news,

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:07.360
from democracies in decline,

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:08.680
to conflict and war,

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:10.200
to a climate in peril.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:12.280
Here's a look back at the year that was

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:14.000
with an eye toward how these events

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.040
will shape the year to come.

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:18.720
Number Ten: Democracy is in retreat.

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:20.240
Democracy almost just

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:21.880
broke down in Guatemala.

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:23.400
Whether it is coups in Africa,

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:25.120
the militarization of politics

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:26.520
in Asia, or the assault

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:27.480
on the rule of law

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:28.480
in the Americas,

00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:30.000
democratic institutions

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.120
are under attack,

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:33.000
imperiling liberty everywhere.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:33.920
The fact that people

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:35.240
on the streets of Niger,

00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:36.600
on the streets of Mali,

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:38.280
on the streets of Burkina Faso,

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:40.080
and now in Gabon, are welcoming

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:41.880
the military does not bode

00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:43.960
well for democracy in Africa.

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:46.360
Number Nine: The space race heats up.

00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:47.120
Space was once

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:48.760
the domain of the superpowers.

00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:50.840
Today, the heavens are open to everyone.

00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:52.320
Both countries and companies

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:53.600
are rushing into space,

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:55.440
fueling dreams of prosperity

00:00:55.440 --> 00:00:57.920
and nightmares of great power conflict.

00:00:57.920 --> 00:00:59.480
From a Space Force perspective,

00:00:59.480 --> 00:01:01.680
we're in a little bit of a different spot

00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:04.320
in that we are now contesting a domain

00:01:04.320 --> 00:01:05.600
that just ten years earlier,

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:07.840
15 years earlier wasn't the case.

00:01:07.840 --> 00:01:08.680
And so we're really trying

00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:10.840
to build for a different what

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:12.240
on a different timeline.

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:14.440
Number Eight: India now has the most people

00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:15.960
of any country in the world.

00:01:15.960 --> 00:01:18.880
With a population of 1.428 billion people,

00:01:18.880 --> 00:01:20.240
the South Asian nation is home

00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:22.760
to nearly a fifth of humanity.

00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:24.320
India's youthful population

00:01:24.320 --> 00:01:26.240
is fueling a vibrant economy.

00:01:26.240 --> 00:01:27.320
Meanwhile, China's

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:29.160
shrinking and aging population

00:01:29.160 --> 00:01:31.040
are raising critical questions

00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:32.200
about its economic

00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:33.480
and political future.

00:01:33.480 --> 00:01:34.480
The Chinese economy

00:01:34.480 --> 00:01:35.840
is about to become a machine

00:01:35.840 --> 00:01:38.800
for taking care of ancient parents and in-laws

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:41.560
and that's going to make for

00:01:41.560 --> 00:01:44.120
big demands for social welfare

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:46.080
benefits for older people.

00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:47.840
Demography isn't destiny,

00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:49.000
but it's close.

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:52.640
Number Seven: Azerbaijan seizes Nagorno-Karabakh.

00:01:52.640 --> 00:01:53.920
After years of unrest

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:55.000
and upheaval.

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:56.640
The war between Nagorno-Karabakh

00:01:56.640 --> 00:01:58.920
and Azerbaijan is finally over.

00:01:58.920 --> 00:02:00.160
Azerbaijan launched

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:01.280
a lightning offensive

00:02:01.280 --> 00:02:02.240
against the Armenian

00:02:02.240 --> 00:02:03.720
enclave in Nagorno-Karabakh.

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:06.120
The crushing Azerbaijani victory

00:02:06.120 --> 00:02:08.280
ended a three-decade-old war

00:02:08.280 --> 00:02:10.120
and triggered a mass exodus

00:02:10.120 --> 00:02:12.280
from Nagorno-Karabakh to Armenia.

00:02:12.280 --> 00:02:14.160
Over a hundred thousand

00:02:14.160 --> 00:02:15.800
Armenians have fled

00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:18.080
the enclave of Nagorno-Karabakh

00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:19.440
since September.

00:02:19.440 --> 00:02:21.280
And the question now is what happens to

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:22.840
those hundred thousand

00:02:22.840 --> 00:02:24.840
living inside Armenia,

00:02:24.840 --> 00:02:26.280
as well as the larger question

00:02:26.280 --> 00:02:27.720
of whether a stable,

00:02:27.720 --> 00:02:29.440
sustainable peace can be created

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:31.360
in this very volatile region.

00:02:31.360 --> 00:02:34.160
Number Six: Civil war wracks Sudan.

00:02:34.160 --> 00:02:36.000
A bid by a paramilitary force

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:37.040
to take power

00:02:37.040 --> 00:02:39.080
from the ruling Sudanese military

00:02:39.080 --> 00:02:41.520
plunged Africa's third largest country

00:02:41.520 --> 00:02:43.160
into a horrific civil war.

00:02:43.160 --> 00:02:44.400
Millions were displaced

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:46.040
as diplomatic efforts to arrange

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:47.920
a cease-fire went nowhere.

00:02:47.920 --> 00:02:49.120
The conflict in Sudan

00:02:49.120 --> 00:02:51.120
is an absolute horror show

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:52.400
for the Sudanese people.

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:54.000
Sudan's potential

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:56.840
disintegration here is incredibly

00:02:56.840 --> 00:02:59.120
destabilizing for an already

00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:00.640
really tough neighborhood.

00:03:00.640 --> 00:03:02.360
Number Five: AI evolved

00:03:02.360 --> 00:03:05.080
at a breathtaking speed in 2023.

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:06.040
Doctors hope AI

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:07.160
can help save lives.

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:08.440
Official intelligence

00:03:08.440 --> 00:03:10.040
is being used to expand

00:03:10.040 --> 00:03:11.840
the power of radiology.

00:03:11.840 --> 00:03:13.240
Optimists hailed the advances

00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:14.560
as opening a new era

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:16.800
of creativity and prosperity.

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:18.240
Pessimists warned that AI

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:20.240
was opening a Pandora's box

00:03:20.240 --> 00:03:21.560
that would doom humanity.

00:03:21.560 --> 00:03:23.360
It is becoming harder to define

00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:24.600
what is human

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:26.120
because we are changing

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:26.680
what is human.

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:27.320
And AI

00:03:27.320 --> 00:03:27.920
is going

00:03:27.920 --> 00:03:30.800
to facilitate that faster than anything

00:03:30.800 --> 00:03:32.280
any of us have ever experienced.

00:03:32.280 --> 00:03:34.520
Number Four: U.S.-China tensions

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:35.560
continue to simmer.

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:36.640
Since President Nixon

00:03:36.640 --> 00:03:37.400
visited China,

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:38.720
the bilateral relationship

00:03:38.720 --> 00:03:40.760
right now is in its lowest point.

00:03:40.760 --> 00:03:41.760
No doubt about that.

00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:43.640
If China were to annex Taiwan,

00:03:43.640 --> 00:03:44.960
the United States would find it

00:03:44.960 --> 00:03:45.880
far more difficult

00:03:45.880 --> 00:03:46.960
to defend its

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:47.880
allies in the region,

00:03:47.880 --> 00:03:48.880
while China would gain

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:50.720
significant power projection.

00:03:50.720 --> 00:03:52.120
A conflict with China

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:53.440
over Taiwan would be

00:03:53.440 --> 00:03:55.320
catastrophically destructive.

00:03:55.320 --> 00:03:56.680
The human costs are almost—

00:03:56.680 --> 00:03:57.560
it’s impossible.

00:03:57.560 --> 00:03:59.720
So making a deterrence

00:03:59.720 --> 00:04:01.560
by denial strategy work,

00:04:01.560 --> 00:04:03.200
preventing World War III is,

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:04.680
I think, the near term objective.

00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:06.520
Hopes that China and the United States

00:04:06.520 --> 00:04:07.960
would place guardrails around

00:04:07.960 --> 00:04:10.080
their growing geopolitical rivalry

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:11.120
were dashed when a

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:12.760
Chinese spy balloon crossed

00:04:12.760 --> 00:04:14.800
the United States in January.

00:04:14.800 --> 00:04:17.400
A Biden-Xi meeting in November was polite,

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:20.120
but failed to yield any major breakthroughs.

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:21.040
The goal of the meeting

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:22.960
was to stabilize the relationship

00:04:22.960 --> 00:04:24.680
heading into 2024,

00:04:24.680 --> 00:04:25.160
when there'll be

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:26.360
elections in Taiwan

00:04:26.360 --> 00:04:26.800
and of course

00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:28.400
in the United States.

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:29.720
There were some modest progress

00:04:29.720 --> 00:04:31.080
on issues like fentanyl

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:31.840
and establishing

00:04:31.840 --> 00:04:34.200
military-to-military communications.

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:35.480
But perhaps the most important

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:36.680
outcome of the meeting

00:04:36.680 --> 00:04:38.680
was that the meeting itself took place.

00:04:38.680 --> 00:04:40.280
Number Three: Ukrainians hoped

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:41.800
that their summer counteroffensive

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:43.760
would break through Russian defenses.

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:44.440
But five months

00:04:44.440 --> 00:04:45.360
of fighting produced

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:47.520
only meager territorial gains.

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:48.640
As winter set in,

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:49.360
the two countries

00:04:49.360 --> 00:04:50.080
seemed locked

00:04:50.080 --> 00:04:51.720
in a bloody war of attrition.

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:53.680
What Russia is trying to do

00:04:53.680 --> 00:04:55.160
cannot succeed.

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:56.400
It's the wrong direction

00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:57.000
for our world.

00:04:57.000 --> 00:04:58.040
And they can't

00:04:58.040 --> 00:05:00.080
redraw the lines on a map

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:01.320
or resettle

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:02.480
what international rules

00:05:02.480 --> 00:05:04.200
based order is.

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:05.960
That's why Ukraine matters.

00:05:05.960 --> 00:05:07.840
Number Two: A new Middle East war

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:08.800
dealt a profound

00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:09.840
setback to efforts

00:05:09.840 --> 00:05:11.240
to build a lasting peace

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:12.120
in the region.

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:14.240
Hamas's recent attack on Israel

00:05:14.240 --> 00:05:15.640
is of unprecedented

00:05:15.640 --> 00:05:17.240
scope and effectiveness.

00:05:17.240 --> 00:05:19.200
Israel's devastating retaliation

00:05:19.200 --> 00:05:20.320
degraded Hamas's

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:21.640
military capabilities,

00:05:21.640 --> 00:05:22.600
but at a heavy price

00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:24.480
for Palestinian civilians.

00:05:24.480 --> 00:05:26.840
I think that it is going to be far

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:27.880
more devastating

00:05:27.880 --> 00:05:29.600
and costly in human lives.

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:31.520
Palestinians want to live in peace

00:05:31.520 --> 00:05:33.040
and freedom and dignity

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:34.640
alongside the state of Israel.

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:35.680
Just as troubling,

00:05:35.680 --> 00:05:38.200
a wider war remains a possibility.

00:05:38.200 --> 00:05:39.680
It's important to see the conflict

00:05:39.680 --> 00:05:40.280
in Gaza

00:05:40.280 --> 00:05:41.200
in the context

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:42.200
of the confrontation

00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:44.000
between Iran and Israel.

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:44.760
Those two countries

00:05:44.760 --> 00:05:45.720
have been engaged in

00:05:45.720 --> 00:05:47.520
what's referred to as a shadow war

00:05:47.520 --> 00:05:48.680
in recent years.

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:50.680
That's what makes a northern front,

00:05:50.680 --> 00:05:53.200
including Iran's proxy Hezbollah,

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:54.200
well within the

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:55.560
realm of possibility.

00:05:55.560 --> 00:05:56.400
Number One:

00:05:56.400 --> 00:05:57.920
Climate change is no longer

00:05:57.920 --> 00:05:59.000
a future threat,

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:00.320
but a current reality.

00:06:00.320 --> 00:06:01.280
Global temperatures

00:06:01.280 --> 00:06:03.040
continue to set new records.

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:03.600
A fierce

00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:04.800
heatwave is gripping

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:06.320
parts of Europe, with temperatures

00:06:06.320 --> 00:06:07.500
reaching more than 40

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:08.560
degrees Celsius.

00:06:08.560 --> 00:06:09.520
Most of our area under

00:06:09.520 --> 00:06:10.680
an air quality alert

00:06:10.680 --> 00:06:11.520
because of smoke

00:06:11.520 --> 00:06:12.280
blowing south

00:06:12.280 --> 00:06:13.760
for more than one hundred wildfires

00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:15.560
burning all the way in Quebec.

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:16.320
Even if you don't care

00:06:16.320 --> 00:06:17.600
about climate change,

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:18.920
you have to realize

00:06:18.920 --> 00:06:19.840
what's happening now

00:06:19.840 --> 00:06:22.320
with the heatwaves, the wildfires, the flooding,

00:06:22.320 --> 00:06:23.960
matters for our security.

00:06:23.960 --> 00:06:24.800
Governments continue

00:06:24.800 --> 00:06:26.280
to meet in solemn forums

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:27.840
that produce more pledges

00:06:27.840 --> 00:06:28.800
than action.

00:06:28.800 --> 00:06:29.840
Humanity may have missed

00:06:29.840 --> 00:06:31.000
its chance to avoid

00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:32.640
catastrophic climate change.

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:35.000
Carbon taxes are not a better idea

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:36.560
because they won't fly.

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:38.680
They’re just talk.

00:06:38.680 --> 00:06:40.320
And we need to get past the talk

00:06:40.320 --> 00:06:59.400
because my grandchild’s time is running out.

